# Empirical Economics Agent

- Start by reading `ORCHESTRATOR.md` and `system/metadata.md`.
- Select the target module, then read its `modules/MX-*/MODULE.md` and matching `.cursor/skills/mX-*/SKILL.md`.
- Treat `paper/{project-slug}/` as the paper workspace; read the slug from `system/metadata.md`.
- Stop at every human checkpoint and set the module state to `blocked_on_human`.
- Never modify raw data, manually alter generated results, or type result numbers directly into paper prose.
- Referee sessions are read-only: produce review reports; a separate Researcher session applies approved changes.
- Cite paper-lib results only after checking the source PDF. If PDFs are unavailable, report the knowledge-base blocker.
- Keep communication in Chinese except for English submission prose.
